// La ventana del flujo F termina (5 min) antes de empezar (20 min).
simulation S { duration 1 h }
intersection A at (0 m, 0 m)
intersection B at 100 m east of A
intersection C at 100 m east of B
road AB from A to B
road BC from B to C
route R = A -> B -> C
flow F along R { spawn 2 every 10 s from 20 min to 5 min }
